&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="content-conclusion"&gt;&lt;h3 id="What-we’ll-offer-you:" data-renderer-start-pos="8044"&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark="true"&gt;What we’ll offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust people to do their best work. That means flexibility over rigid rules, impact over activity, and real investment in your growth both professionally and personally. You’ll be part of a supportive, and friendly culture, surrounded by smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer flexible working, including hybrid and remote options. Our office hubs are located in Edinburgh, Leeds, Manchester, London and Bulgaria, with occasional travel to client sites or CreateFuture offices when needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We trust you to manage your time balancing collaboration with client time and focused work. What matters is the impact you have, not how busy you look.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We try to keep our hiring process clear, fair and respectful of your time. We aim to get back to everyone who applies and we will be upfront about where you are in the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It usually looks like this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Call with our Talent Acquisition Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Role specific capability interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on the role, we might also ask you to do a short presentation, a practical or technical task or have a values focused conversation. We will explain what is involved before anything happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at CreateFuture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe diverse teams build better workplaces and better products. We want CreateFuture to be a place where people feel able to be themselves and do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any adjustments or support during the application process, just. We will do what we can to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

arbeitnow:senior-product-manager-members:
&lt;p data-path-to-node="0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Senior Product Manager - Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="1"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="1" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Lille or Paris, France&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="2"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="2" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Domain:&lt;/strong&gt; Omnicommerce &amp;amp; Customer — Loyalty &amp;amp; Account Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="4"&gt;About Decathlon &amp;amp; The Omnicommerce Domain&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="5"&gt;Decathlon is accelerating its digital transformation with the mission of becoming the sports digital platform that allows customers to discover our universe through local, sport-centered, and omnichannel experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="6"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="6" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Our Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="7"&gt;By joining this scope, you will work within the &lt;strong data-path-to-node="7" data-index-in-node="48"&gt;Omnicommerce &amp;amp; Customer&lt;/strong&gt; Unit. Our mission is to leverage cutting-edge technology to build trusted, seamless, and deeply personalized relationships at scale. We design the platforms that connect our members to the entire Decathlon ecosystem—online, on mobile, and in our physical stores worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="9"&gt;Join the Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount Squad&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="10"&gt;Reporting to the Membership Group Product Manager, you will take end-to-end ownership of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="10" data-index-in-node="114"&gt;Membership &amp;amp; MyAccount&lt;/strong&gt; Product Team across our 3 front platforms: Responsive Web, iOS, and Android.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="11"&gt;You will lead a multi-disciplinary team alongside a dedicated Engineering Manager, Software Engineers (Web, iOS, Android), Product Designers, Data Analysts, and Product Marketing Managers (PMM), while partnering closely with central sports teams and local Country Loyalty leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="12"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="12,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="12,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Product Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Empowering enduring customer relationships through a frictionless, rewarding, and deeply personalized omnichannel membership journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="12,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="12,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;The Mission:&lt;/strong&gt; Transition our membership product from a historical "Run" maintenance state into a high-tempo value delivery engine. You will drive identified omnichannel transactions, member lifetime value, and profile enrichment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="14"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node="14"&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="15"&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="16"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="16,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Define Vision &amp;amp; Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and drive the end-to-end product vision, strategy, and outcome-based roadmap for Membership and MyAccount across Web, iOS, and Android.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="16,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Accelerate Transformation:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the operational shift from run-mode maintenance to a high-velocity feature delivery model, turning the membership space into a core business growth lever.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="16,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;"Build vs. Buy" Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="16,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="16,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Strategic Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Bridge central business objectives with local country requirements, establishing a unified global membership experience while accommodating local market nuances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="17"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="17"&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Experimentation&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="18"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="18,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="18,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Continuous Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover high-impact member friction points through quantitative analytics, regular user interviews, usability testing, and benchmark studies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="18,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="18,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;UX/UI Simplification:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Design and Research to streamline complex account features, rewards catalogs, and loyalty point visibility into intuitive, engaging cross-platform interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="18,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="18,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Experimentation Framework:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish continuous A/B testing and multivariate testing processes to validate hypotheses on member engagement, opt-in mechanics, and reward redemption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="19"&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; Technical Alignment&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="20"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Agile Product Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer sprint cycles and backlog prioritization in tight synergy with the Engineering Lead, Mobile Engineers, and Web Developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Backlog Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Write precise Epics, User Stories, and robust acceptance criteria; anticipate cross-squad dependencies and ensure smooth release management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Cross-Journey Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Core E-Commerce teams (Cart, Checkout, PDP) and In-Store Cashtill teams to seamlessly embed member identification, instant rewards, and profile perks across all purchasing journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="20,3,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="20,3,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Go-to-Market Orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Synchronize feature releases with Product Marketing Managers (PMM) and local digital teams, orchestrating simultaneous rollouts across Web and App Stores (iOS / Android).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node="21"&gt;Data &amp;amp; Performance&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="22"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="22,0,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="22,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Define &amp;amp; Monitor KPIs:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and steer North Star and operational metrics:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node="22,0,1"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="22,0,1,0,0"&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node="22,0,1,0,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Identification:&lt;/em&gt; Total Active Members, Profile Completion Rate (PCR), and Omnichannel Identified Transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node="22,0,1,1,0"&gt;&lt;em data-path-to-node="22,0,1,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Loyalty Economics:&lt;/em&gt; Points Issued vs. Redeemed, Burn Rate, Member Lifetime Value (LTV), and Reward Engagement Rate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
