&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,1,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,1,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Recent experience in the Data Protection industry with a passionate, informed point of view to share with customers and partners.&lt;/p&gt;
