&lt;p data-path-to-node="23,2,0"&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node="23,2,0" data-index-in-node="0"&gt;Analytical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in data-driven territory management and plan&lt;/p&gt;
